{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_31", "source_id": "64dc8637000000001700d8ec", "title": "其实不是黑，是黄！平价去黄气方法来了～", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64dc8637000000001700d8ec", "topic_family": "提亮与肤色", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "正常经验内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 982, "evidence_unit_count": 30, "original_evidence_unit_count": 30, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 100, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["先给你们看一下我之前的样子 跟现在完全是派对我两人 以前的素颜看起来就是那种土黑土黑的", "但是一到下午那个脸色看起来 就像是刚去田地干活回来 因为夏天温度特别高", "但是在夏天真的不想用它们 太油腻了 就感觉整个脸都会呼起来了", "帮我们促进交易单白的身长 所以用了它之后呢 会感觉肤色变亮", "它都可以做到 这一瓶可以解决我们油 到期很多的护肤需求", "对抗自由机 防止皮肤氧化 所以我们如果想要精洁 有效的护肤", "先给你们看一下我之前的样子 跟现在完全是派对我两人 以前的素颜看起来就是那种土黑土黑的"], "retained_quotes": ["对抗自由机 防止皮肤氧化 所以我们如果想要精洁 有效的护肤", "先给你们看一下我之前的样子 跟现在完全是派对我两人 以前的素颜看起来就是那种土黑土黑的"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64dc8637000000001700d8ec/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64dc8637000000001700d8ec/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64dc8637000000001700d8ec/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64dc8637000000001700d8ec/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "17d2950b0be65c4cc5a3123f2a15192f5dd6da4f5b4253deb38a584c3ab38728", "card_hash": "e5d94bf7f606a552e0c6f66eb7b487156a88648bb9df12a527e3fa21207bfc83", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_31", "source_id": "64d71c44000000000301cf55", "title": "去闭口其实很简单", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64d71c44000000000301cf55", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 862, "evidence_unit_count": 26, "original_evidence_unit_count": 26, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["去闭口其实非常简单，很多人都把它想复杂了", "需要做的就是去针清，趁着闭口还没有爆发成痘痘就把里面的角栓清出来", "） 那是因为酸有加速皮肤新陈代谢的效果，把闭口都催熟了", "但如果我们想要一颗闭口都不长，皮肤细腻光滑的像水煮蛋，就一定要做深层清洁", "之前整个额头上全是闭口，显得妆感好差 现在皮肤好光滑了～开心 你们快试试", "你先去针清，再用酸，就不会有这个烂脸期 另外我们大部分女孩子脸颊都偏薄，和男生不同，所以我们用酸只能用在角质厚的区域", "但如果我们想要一颗闭口都不长，皮肤细腻光滑的像水煮蛋，就一定要做深层清洁"], "retained_quotes": ["你先去针清，再用酸，就不会有这个烂脸期 另外我们大部分女孩子脸颊都偏薄，和男生不同，所以我们用酸只能用在角质厚的区域", "但如果我们想要一颗闭口都不长，皮肤细腻光滑的像水煮蛋，就一定要做深层清洁"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64d71c44000000000301cf55/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64d71c44000000000301cf55/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64d71c44000000000301cf55/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64d71c44000000000301cf55/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "b81c238365eeaf57ab7997e0157181ae76fb725c834d6921967bb9e3d8f1a2be", "card_hash": "a6bed085eb22933b2d09d3fc0565a5a3e1de9123233ea66da52aaa1bef43a222", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_31", "source_id": "64cf8ef6000000000103d455", "title": "护肤vlog｜痘肌晒后舒缓晚间护肤routine", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64cf8ef6000000000103d455", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1076, "evidence_unit_count": 30, "original_evidence_unit_count": 30, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 80, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 跟我一起胡克斯巴 今天卸了一个妆", "所以今天的后复主题 我想以晒后消货为主 它这些脑膏香味之后 这里是一种蓄衣草味道", "它这上面写要敷30分钟 但我们要敷25分钟 好 一会儿进", "我怕带到这边把酸带过来 而刺激剩下的这些再涂在涂过酸的区域", "再拿一点当镜霜 好了 这个反肩护肤结束了 这个成糕和我的衣服", "因为我家也是我的这个之间 所以我想要弄的温馨一点 之前的之间 我觉得老师那个被子算好开", "好了 现在我把你洗净净了 我先去洗澡 如果有 我回来了 现在外面就在下暴雨 你能听到吗"], "retained_quotes": ["因为我家也是我的这个之间 所以我想要弄的温馨一点 之前的之间 我觉得老师那个被子算好开", "好了 现在我把你洗净净了 我先去洗澡 如果有 我回来了 现在外面就在下暴雨 你能听到吗"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64cf8ef6000000000103d455/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64cf8ef6000000000103d455/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64cf8ef6000000000103d455/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64cf8ef6000000000103d455/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "ca1c747cfef81e6d0172df927ad27080e4039f5cedeb612e215b5ec3e3c628da", "card_hash": "454c98464390853f240f52af1fea913555413b5759c498df7cc91ff7500d2aea", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learne